      "level": 1,
      "topic": "daily life",
      "title_zh": "明天考试",
      "title_en": "Exam tomorrow",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["明天", "有", "考试", "，", "我", "还", "没有", "准备", "好", "。"],
        ["晚上", "，", "我", "的", "同学", "来", "我", "家", "。", "她", "说", "：", "“", "我", "来", "帮忙", "！", "”"],
        ["我们", "一起", "学", "了", "三", "个", "小时", "。", "我", "不", "明白", "的", "，", "她", "都", "告诉", "我", "。", "她", "非常", "认真", "。"],
        ["第二", "天", "，", "考试", "不", "难", "！", "我", "都", "会", "写", "。", "我", "很", "高兴", "。"],
        ["我", "请", "她", "吃饭", "。", "我", "说", "：", "“", "谢谢", "你", "帮", "我", "！", "”"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "There's an exam tomorrow, and I'm not ready yet.",
        "In the evening my classmate came over. She said: “I’ll help!”",
        "We studied together for three hours. Whatever I didn’t understand, she explained. She was really thorough.",
        "The next day, the exam wasn't hard! I could answer everything. I was so happy.",
        "I took her out for a meal. I said: “Thanks for helping me!”"
      ],
