      "topic": "football",
      "title_zh": "我跑起来很慢",
      "title_en": "I'm slow",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "常", "和", "朋友", "们", "玩", "球", "。", "我", "跑", "起来", "很", "慢", "，", "有时候", "一", "个", "球", "也", "进", "不", "了", "。"],
        ["我", "的", "一", "个", "朋友", "跑", "起来", "非常", "快", "。"],
        ["今天", "，", "他", "站", "在", "我", "旁边", "，", "说", "：", "“", "我", "来", "教", "你", "！", "”"],
        ["他", "教", "了", "我", "一", "个", "小时", "。", "最后", "，", "我", "进", "了", "一", "个", "球", "！"],
        ["朋友", "们", "都", "笑", "了", "，", "我", "也", "很", "高兴", "。", "下", "次", "我", "还", "要", "跟", "他", "学", "！"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "I often play football with my friends. I'm slow, and sometimes I can't score a single goal.",
        "One of my friends is really fast.",
        "Today he stood next to me and said: “Let me teach you!”",
        "He taught me for an hour. In the end, I scored a goal!",
        "My friends all laughed, and I was really happy too. Next time I want to learn from him again!"
      ],
